This project provides an encrypted task delivery and execution tool for multi-agent,
cross-device workflows. It protects sensitive human intent, scripts, and
credentials by ensuring that no plaintext leaves the device and that delegated scripts
can only be executed — never read — by the target node. No part of the MGC core system
may be modified, redistributed, or used to create derivative works without official
authorization.

